{
  "name": "P31c - Lumière Delivery Status",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d-webhook",
      "name": "Twilio Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lumiere-wa-status",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-parse",
      "name": "Parse Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Twilio calls this for every status change of a message we sent (queued, sent, delivered, read, failed, undelivered).\n// Twilio avisa cada cambio de estado de un mensaje enviado. Solo nos importan los que cambian algo.\nconst b = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst status = String(b.MessageStatus || b.SmsStatus || '').toLowerCase();\nconst KEEP = ['delivered', 'read', 'failed', 'undelivered'];\nif (!KEEP.includes(status) || !b.MessageSid) return [];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  wa_message_sid: String(b.MessageSid),\n  status,\n  error_code: String(b.ErrorCode || ''),\n  failed: status === 'failed' || status === 'undelivered'\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-find",
      "name": "Find Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": 1001,
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Conversaciones",
          "cachedResultUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID/edit#gid=1001"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "wa_message_sid",
              "lookupValue": "={{ $json.wa_message_sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-decide",
      "name": "Decide Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Only move forward: queued < sent < delivered < read; failed/undelivered is final. Callbacks can arrive out of order.\n// Solo se avanza: queued < sent < delivered < read; failed/undelivered es final. Los avisos pueden llegar desordenados.\nconst s = $('Parse Status').first().json;\nconst row = $input.first().json || {};\nif (!row.row_number) return []; // not one of ours (or not logged) / no es nuestro\nconst RANK = { queued: 0, accepted: 0, sent: 1, delivered: 2, read: 3 };\nconst current = String(row.estado_entrega || '').toLowerCase();\nconst currentFinal = current.startsWith('failed') || current.startsWith('undelivered') || current.startsWith('error');\nif (currentFinal) return [];\nif (!s.failed && (RANK[s.status] ?? 0) <= (RANK[current] ?? 0)) return [];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  wa_message_sid: s.wa_message_sid,\n  estado_entrega: s.failed ? s.status + (s.error_code ? ' (error ' + s.error_code + ')' : '') : s.status,\n  failed: s.failed,\n  lead_id: row.lead_id,\n  rol: row.rol\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-update",
      "name": "Update Delivery Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": 1001,
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Conversaciones",
          "cachedResultUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID/edit#gid=1001"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "wa_message_sid": "={{ $json.wa_message_sid }}",
            "estado_entrega": "={{ $json.estado_entrega }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "wa_message_sid"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "wa_message_sid",
              "displayName": "wa_message_sid",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "estado_entrega",
              "displayName": "estado_entrega",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-iffail",
      "name": "Client Message Failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "ff1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Decide Update').first().json.failed && $('Decide Update').first().json.rol === 'assistant' }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-ctx",
      "name": "Get Client Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_P31D_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-ifopener",
      "name": "Opener Never Arrived?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "op1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.found === true && $json.lead.estado === 'contactado' }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-mark",
      "name": "Mark Contact Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1680,
        700
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": 1000,
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Leads",
          "cachedResultUrl": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID/edit#gid=1000"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "lead_id": "={{ $json.lead.lead_id }}",
            "estado": "contacto_fallido",
            "ultima_actualizacion": "={{ $now.setZone('America/Phoenix').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "lead_id"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "lead_id",
              "displayName": "lead_id",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "estado",
              "displayName": "estado",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "ultima_actualizacion",
              "displayName": "ultima_actualizacion",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-main",
      "name": "Sticky Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1240,
        "height": 250,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## P31 - Delivery Status / Estado de entrega\n**EN:** Twilio accepts a message (201) and can fail later. Every message is sent with a StatusCallback to this webhook: Conversaciones.estado_entrega moves forward (delivered, read, failed). If the opening message never arrived, the lead becomes contacto_fallido so nobody waits for an answer that cannot come.\n\n**ES:** Twilio acepta el mensaje (201) y puede fallar después. Cada mensaje sale con StatusCallback a este webhook: Conversaciones.estado_entrega avanza (delivered, read, failed). Si la apertura nunca llegó, el lead queda contacto_fallido para que nadie espere una respuesta que no puede llegar."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-1",
      "name": "Note - Twilio Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "📡 TWILIO STATUS / ESTADO DE TWILIO\n\nTwilio reports every status change of a message we sent.\nTwilio avisa cada cambio de estado de un mensaje que enviamos."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-2",
      "name": "Note - Parse Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🧹 PARSE STATUS / LEER ESTADO\n\nKeeps only delivered, read, failed and undelivered.\nSolo deja delivered, read, failed y undelivered."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-3",
      "name": "Note - Find Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🔎 FIND MESSAGE / BUSCAR MENSAJE\n\nThe Conversaciones row with that message SID.\nLa fila de Conversaciones con ese SID de mensaje."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-4",
      "name": "Note - Decide Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🧮 DECIDE UPDATE / DECIDIR ACTUALIZACIÓN\n\nStatus only moves forward; callbacks can arrive out of order.\nEl estado solo avanza; los avisos pueden llegar desordenados."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-5",
      "name": "Note - Update Delivery Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🗂️ UPDATE DELIVERY STATUS / ACTUALIZAR ENTREGA\n\nWrites estado_entrega in Conversaciones.\nEscribe estado_entrega en Conversaciones."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-6",
      "name": "Note - Client Message Failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 210,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🔀 CLIENT MESSAGE FAILED? / ¿FALLÓ UN MENSAJE A LA CLIENTA?\n\nOnly failed messages from the assistant go on.\nSolo siguen los mensajes fallidos de la asistente."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-7",
      "name": "Note - Get Client Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 210,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🧩 GET CLIENT CONTEXT / TRAER CONTEXTO\n\nCurrent lead status from P31d.\nEstado actual del lead desde P31d."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-8",
      "name": "Note - Opener Never Arrived?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1380,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 210,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🔀 OPENER NEVER ARRIVED? / ¿LA APERTURA NUNCA LLEGÓ?\n\nTrue if the lead is still contactado: she never got our first message.\nSí si el lead sigue contactado: nunca recibió el primer mensaje."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dn-9",
      "name": "Note - Mark Contact Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 210,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "🚫 MARK CONTACT FAILED / MARCAR CONTACTO FALLIDO\n\nLeads.estado = contacto_fallido so P32 uses email instead.\nLeads.estado = contacto_fallido para que P32 use email."
      }
    }
  ],
